      "content": "thanks for the summary. it's a good start but honestly it's a bit too short for our needs. the product team is going to want way more detail on specific features like the camera, the display, and the software issues before they make a call. can you expand this out? try to go much more in-depth so the word count is higher and we have a really hefty report. just make sure it's actually useful info and not just the same stuff repeated over and over.",
